          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP596 Old Entrance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This one is near the Black Cat Ranch where Mr. CanoeHead did some horseback riding - back in the day when we lived in Leduc.  TFTCap!&lt;/p&gt;

