          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP596 Old Entrance

We concluded a day of canoeing in William Switzer Park with some brass caps on the way back out.   A short hike up the sandy hill had this one in hand quickly.  Lots of deer and elk tracks in the sand.   TFTCap&lt;/p&gt;

